## Verdict Details

### Verdict: {{ verdict }}

{% if verdict == "ALIVE" %}

#### ALIVE Criteria Met

All required criteria for an ALIVE checkpoint have been satisfied:

- [x] All artifacts successfully generated ({{ total_artifacts }} total)
- [x] All proof gates passed ({{ gates_evaluated }}/{{ gates_evaluated }} passing)
- [x] Conformance score ≥ 85% ({{ conformance_score }}% achieved)
- [x] Event log proves lawful execution
- [x] All negative tests passed
- [x] Warrant path proof is valid
- [x] No model-vs-log contradictions
- [x] All artifacts have valid lifecycle
- [x] Cryptographic receipt chain verified

**Status:** Production Ready

**Next Actions:**
- Release authorized
- Downstream consumption may proceed
- Artifact registry updated
- Receipt chain sealed

{% elsif verdict == "PARTIAL" %}

#### PARTIAL Findings

This checkpoint is PARTIAL because the following gates have not achieved ALIVE status:

{% for failing_gate in failing_gates %}
- **{{ failing_gate.gate_name }}** — {{ failing_gate.reason }}
{% endfor %}

**Remediation Required:** Yes, {{ remediation_count }} remediations
**Estimated Effort:** {{ estimated_remediation_hours }}h
**Blocker Status:** {{ blocker_status }}

**Next Actions:**
- Execute remediation plan (see `remediation-plan.md`)
- Re-run ggen with corrected sources/rules
- Resubmit for checkpoint evaluation

{% elsif verdict == "FAILED" %}

#### FAILED Status

This checkpoint has FAILED due to critical defects that prevent lawful execution:

{% for critical_defect in critical_defects %}
- **{{ critical_defect.name }}** — {{ critical_defect.description }}
  - **Impact:** {{ critical_defect.impact }}
  - **Recovery:** {{ critical_defect.recovery }}
{% endfor %}

**Restart Required:** Yes
**Previous Checkpoint Valid:** {{ previous_checkpoint_valid }}

**Next Actions:**
- Investigate root causes
- Debug ggen configuration
- Review process model declaration
- Engage architecture review

{% endif %}

